# The frontend development image (Compose) builds from the repository root (gaulatti/alcantara#741, following #590).
# It needs the workspace manifests, the lockfile and the frontend source. Everything else stays out of the context.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!backend/package.json
!infra/aws/package.json
!e2e/package.json
!frontend/
frontend/node_modules
frontend/build
frontend/.react-router
frontend/coverage
frontend/.env
frontend/npm-debug.log*
frontend/pnpm-debug.log*
